{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1390648-what-should-a-solar-circus-look-like","id":1390648,"title":"What should a Solar Circus look like?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Solar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-05-21T16:09:16-07:00","id":1390648,"title":"What should a Solar Circus look like?","content":"I am looking for inspiration.<br /> <br /> I am playing a Solar who is the owner of a circus. (This is for 2nd Edition)<br /> <br /> She is a &quot;Go big or go home&quot; kind of person, so what types of attractions should &amp; could a Solar muster as they start out &amp; develop?<br /> <br /> Currently she has wind-whales she uses to fly the circus around &amp; perform flying Shamu style tricks. She has a pet tyrant lizard she has taught to play the drums while she does her own performances.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4428,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil","user":"Daredevil","date":". 05-21-2020, 07:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil","name":"Daredevil","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4428_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"404"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-21T17:28:11-07:00","id":1390662,"title":"","content":"Could she befriend some Elementals that can produce cool displays of fire or other elements? Or other Spirits.<br /> <br /> Of course if there are other Exalts participating in the performance they should show off their own appropriate abilities, but it sounds like probably not.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25834-habitableexoplanet","name":"habitableexoplanet","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"296"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-21T19:10:50-07:00","id":1390680,"title":"","content":"What sort of skill set do they have besides animal training and what other exalts are there along with their skills?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted Whose Name is Carved in Leaves of Jade<br /> Senator of the Greater Chamber<br /> Champion of the Silver Pact<br /> Chosen of the Little Gods<br /> Agent of Fate","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/988-mizu","name":"Mizu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar988_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-21T19:54:40-07:00","id":1390688,"title":"","content":"Have her accumulate a merry band of Wyld mutants and inspire them to perform soul-stirring musical numbers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Burn Legend -- Advent of Yomi Wan <a href=\"http://burnlegend.blogspot.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://burnlegend.blogspot.com/</a><br /> EX3 -- Dawn of Resurgent Sun <a href=\"https://resurgentsun.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://resurgentsun.wordpress.com/</a>","edited":{"userid":3140,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3140-greyeyes","user":"GreyEyes","date":". 05-21-2020, 10:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3140-greyeyes","name":"GreyEyes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3140_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-22T01:50:18-07:00","id":1390731,"title":"","content":"I personally am a big fan of the animal circus. By and large, I support the use of performing animals -- whether tamed or domesticated.<br /> <br /> But, animal abuse does exist in animal circuses -- both historically and in a significant chunk of the animal circuses which operate today.<br /> <br /> A Solar circus, with Performance and Athletics Charms could distinguish itself by NOT using animal acts. Alternatively, between Survival and Ride Charms one could emphasise how well cared for the animals are and how vital they seem.<br /> <br /> Seeing a lion is an incredible, inspiring thing. Seeing a half-starved lion with mange chained to a post, not so much.<br /> <br /> (Or you could lean into it. Unnatural Mental Influence for the Anathema Circus of Horrors. Bound demons. Zombies. Dragon-Blooded in cages. Dragon King freak shows. All that jazz.)<br /> <br /> How big an issue is the Wyld Hunt?<br /> <br /> Are you kicking off every act with a totemic anima display? Are you trying to pass off supernatural magics as simple legerdemain moving your circus family on so your enemies can never find you?<br /> <br /> I think fireworks and lightshows are in order. Sword dancers from Jiara (if it exists in your setting). Fire eaters from the frozen north. Physical comedy clowns (Earth Elementals?). Djarla acrobats. Creation's Strongest Man. You know. Normal circus stuff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-22T23:31:46-07:00","id":1390920,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>habitableexoplanet</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1390648-what-should-a-solar-circus-look-like?p=1390662#post1390662\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Could she befriend some Elementals that can produce cool displays of fire or other elements? Or other Spirits.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> She can't bind any yet, but she does have a lot of Presence &amp; could try Natural Influence.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Wait. She has enough Resources to hire a competent Thaumaturge to do the binding.<br /> <br /> Are there any Elementals you recommend in particular?<br /> <br /> I wounder if an applauding crowed would count as prayers?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mizu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1390648-what-should-a-solar-circus-look-like?p=1390680#post1390680\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What sort of skill set do they have besides animal training and what other exalts are there along with their skills?</div> </div> </div> </div>Larceny Excellency (Magic Tricks!), Flawlessly Impenetrable Disguise, Friendship with Animals Approach,<br /> <br /> 2nd Performance, Excellency Respecting Commanding Attitude,<br /> <br /> 2nd Presence Excellency, Enemy-Castigating Solar Judgement<br /> <br /> 2 Martial Arts Excellencies, Lots of Dodge Charms (basic Paranoia Combo).<br /> <br /> Resources 5.<br /> <br /> So she can sing, dance, perform magic tricks, tame unusual animals, perform martial arts demonstrations, &amp; dodge like a leaf in the wind.<br /> <br /> She can also afford a LOT of fire dust &amp; crazy stage setups.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GreyEyes</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1390648-what-should-a-solar-circus-look-like?p=1390688#post1390688\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Have her accumulate a merry band of Wyld mutants and inspire them to perform soul-stirring musical numbers.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Love it. This is now a side quest.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4428,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil","user":"Daredevil","date":". 05-23-2020, 03:01 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil","name":"Daredevil","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4428_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"404"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-22T23:50:52-07:00","id":1390922,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1390648-what-should-a-solar-circus-look-like?p=1390731#post1390731\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A Solar circus, with Performance and Athletics Charms could distinguish itself by NOT using animal acts. Alternatively, between Survival and Ride Charms one could emphasise how well cared for the animals are and how vital they seem.</div> </div> </div> </div>Reading this does help me realize I do want to focus of a managerie feel for the circus, over all.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1390648-what-should-a-solar-circus-look-like?p=1390731#post1390731\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Or you could lean into it. Unnatural Mental Influence for the Anathema Circus of Horrors. Bound demons. Zombies. Dragon-Blooded in cages. Dragon King freak shows. All that jazz.)</div> </div> </div> </div>I definitely want her to be a benevolent type, but the idea of gathering supernatural performers to teach people about them would be fascinating &amp; could build larger coalitions of powers.<br /> <br /> Oh. Teddy Roosevelt styled circus ringmaster! I like that. &amp; she won't have to stuff them! (I better think of buying Archery &amp; invest in Prayer Pieces, though.)<br /> <br /> She does love a good scare, though. So it might be hilarious to gradually build a shock/horror section with willing participants (Ghost-Bloods, etc.) Excellent idea. This could build off greatly on the ol' freak show shtick.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1390648-what-should-a-solar-circus-look-like?p=1390731#post1390731\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How big an issue is the Wyld Hunt?<br /> <br /> Are you kicking off every act with a totemic anima display? Are you trying to pass off supernatural magics as simple legerdemain moving your circus family on so your enemies can never find you?</div> </div> </div> </div>She definitely wants to hide her <i>Anathama</i> status as long as she can so she can win the hearts &amp; minds of as many as possible before the cat is out of the bag.<br /> <br /> I <i>think</i> Flawlessly Impenetrable Disguise would let her get away with a lot, in a I AM NOT SUPERMAN. HE DOES NOT WEAR GLASSES sort of way, but I'll have to confer with my ST to see how he reads it.<br /> <br /> In my reading, even iconic totem displays could be written off by everyone with the right BS disguise/excuse.<br /> <br /> Solar- &quot;I'm a Fire Outcast who's anima is a warm, yellow glow. Honest.&quot;<br /> <br /> Wyld Hunt- &quot;Well, that's OBVIOUS! We totally believe you, you paranoid goof!&quot;<br /> <br /> Solar- &quot;And my name is Clark Kent.&quot;<br /> <br /> Wyld Hunt- &quot;Yeah. You're name tag says that. We get it. You OK? Sun stroke? Here. Drink some water. It's hot out here.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1390648-what-should-a-solar-circus-look-like?p=1390731#post1390731\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think fireworks and lightshows are in order. Sword dancers from Jiara (if it exists in your setting). Fire eaters from the frozen north. Physical comedy clowns (Earth Elementals?). Djarla acrobats. Creation's Strongest Man. You know. Normal circus stuff.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is just brilliant. I am glad I thought of it.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://sspthinksfilm.files.wordpress.com/2013/12/hook.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4428,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil","user":"Daredevil","date":". 05-23-2020, 03:02 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil","name":"Daredevil","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4428_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"404"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-23T11:30:04-07:00","id":1391004,"title":"","content":"elementals, ghosts, demons, robots, weapon exhibits, armor exhibits, warstriders, pure and raw essence taken from the poles, all kinds of go big goodies","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/359-dezeroth","name":"Dezeroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar359_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"496"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-23T12:26:41-07:00","id":1391015,"title":"","content":"Take a cue from Medieval Times and have Exalt competitions, where the crowd gets amped up to cheer on &quot;their&quot; competitor.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Hey, check out my first original RPG, <i>Post-Mortem, </i>here: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/307131/PostMortem\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/307131/PostMortem</a><br /> <br /> Or read my Exalted novella <i>The Silence of Our Ancestors</i> here: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/304805/The-Silence-of-Our-Ancestors-A-DragonBlooded-Novella\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product...looded-Novella</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1961-dex-davican","name":"Dex Davican","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1961_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"362"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-23T13:20:36-07:00","id":1391033,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dex Davican</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1390648-what-should-a-solar-circus-look-like?p=1391015#post1391015\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Take a cue from Medieval Times and have Exalt competitions, where the crowd gets amped up to cheer on &quot;their&quot; competitor.</div> </div> </div> </div>One step over is using wrestling setups.<br /> <br /> &quot;All rise for the Realm national anthem!&quot;<br /> <br /> (is booed by obviously non-Realm crowd as heel)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-23T13:28:34-07:00","id":1391034,"title":"","content":"I see a potential rivalry with the Melkin Fool in Red and her Circus Moribund. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-24T01:16:49-07:00","id":1391143,"title":"","content":"And the Mirror Flag. Man, Exalted has a lot of carnival and circus folk.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-24T10:34:46-07:00","id":1391214,"title":"","content":"Main reason I mentioned the Abyssal was that she has strong potential to be a cool antitesis and help solidify the vision for Daredevil's character. I wouldn't suggest the same for Mirror Flag because she's a Solar and a meme.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-24T11:06:20-07:00","id":1391217,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1390648-what-should-a-solar-circus-look-like?p=1391214#post1391214\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Main reason I mentioned the Abyssal was that she has strong potential to be a cool antitesis and help solidify the vision for Daredevil's character. I wouldn't suggest the same for Mirror Flag because she's a Solar and a meme.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think if you run Tomb of Dreams as a prelude, you can nicely introduce Faka Kun and Mirror Flag as potential rivals and allies then build up to a full on Abyssal adversary.<br /> <br /> But, you know, 3E.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-24T21:57:20-07:00","id":1391425,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dex Davican</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1390648-what-should-a-solar-circus-look-like?p=1391015#post1391015\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Take a cue from Medieval Times and have Exalt competitions, where the crowd gets amped up to cheer on &quot;their&quot; competitor.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1390648-what-should-a-solar-circus-look-like?p=1391033#post1391033\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> One step over is using wrestling setups.<br /> <br /> &quot;All rise for the Realm national anthem!&quot;<br /> <br /> (is booed by obviously non-Realm crowd as heel)</div> </div> </div> </div>This idea is magnificent.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1390648-what-should-a-solar-circus-look-like?p=1391034#post1391034\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I see a potential rivalry with the Melkin Fool in Red and her Circus Moribund.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wow. Cool.<br /> <br /> Which book is she in?<br /> <br /> I find this an odd coincidence, as my PC is a Jester.<br /> <br /> (I thought I was original! Now I must sue to prove it to be true...)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil","name":"Daredevil","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4428_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"404"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-24T23:40:33-07:00","id":1391431,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Daredevil</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1390648-what-should-a-solar-circus-look-like?p=1391425#post1391425\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wow. Cool.<br /> <br /> Which book is she in?<br /> <br /> I find this an odd coincidence, as my PC is a Jester.<br /> <br /> (I thought I was original! Now I must sue to prove it to be true...)</div> </div> </div> </div>She's never gotten a full write-up just a frequent <s>name</s> title drop under servants of the Lover Clad. <br /> However her image is used for the &quot;Day Caste Assassin&quot; in the Storyteller's Companion and she appears in the first comic in Compass Underworld.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-05T12:58:40-07:00","id":1394413,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1390648-what-should-a-solar-circus-look-like?p=1391431#post1391431\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">She's never gotten a full write-up just a frequent <s>name</s> title drop under servants of the Lover Clad.<br /> However her image is used for the &quot;Day Caste Assassin&quot; in the Storyteller's Companion and she appears in the first comic in Compass Underworld.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh! I remember the Abyssal comic. That was a good one. I am surprsied one of the writers hasn't expanded on her circus/freak-show yet. I got confused when I looked up her name online &amp; found this pic with <a href=\"https://exalted-thesunalsorises.obsidianportal.com/characters/melkin-fool-in-red\" target=\"_blank\">her description</a>.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://exalted-thesunalsorises.obsidianportal.com/characters/melkin-fool-in-red\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://db4sgowjqfwig.cloudfront.net/images/1032446/1360015490562.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a><br /> I would be fun for the two to meet.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil","name":"Daredevil","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4428_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"404"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-11T06:32:37-07:00","id":1395829,"title":"","content":"Yeah, people who do game wikis have this odd tendency to &quot;recast&quot; canonical characters.<br /> That one also has Gilgamesh as Filial Wisdom which strikes me as something that'd be pretty distracting for most groups.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"re